; run: --read-core tests/hs/core/lib/base.core --read-core tests/hs/core/lib/strings.core
; rhc's runtime (CoreRuntime) on strings, the program of lib/strings.core:
; a literal, UTF-8 in a Str, unpacked into its characters as the list is
; read (D24's A, primUnpackString), past ASCII in two, three and four
; bytes; a byte that starts no sequence of UTF-8 read as the character of
; its number, as are a sequence cut short and an overlong one; a String
; packed into a Str again (rtPack, in n log n); putChar of each character
; (UTF-8 out); the Report's error and userError of a String; and Char's
; primIntToChar, primCharToInt and primUnicodeMaxChar. The runtime is
; linked into the program as far as the program reaches it.
; runtime-strings-whole.core runs the same with every cell made at once.
